sequenceDiagram
    %% Main successful flow; validation and alternatives are described in the guide.
    participant P0 as Duke
    participant P1 as GenerateReceiptsCommand
    participant P2 as ReceiptGenerator
    participant P3 as OrderList
    participant P4 as Ui
    P0->>P1: execute(...)
    P1->>P2: generate(orders, customer)
    P2->>P3: getAll()
    P3-->>P2: Order history
    P2-->>P1: Matching active orders
    P1->>P4: showReceipts(...)
